{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113198474762289152"]}, "author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-22T09:19:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113198488242749679"], "id": "2113198488242749679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 904, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113088761865318660", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "在市场全面看涨时做空\n 市场的陷阱无处不在——多头陷阱是空头的天堂。卖点恰恰藏在共识最浓的地方。\n \n为什么敢空：全面看涨时做空，不是逆势逞英雄，是结构给出了卖点，只是执行。\n\n 全面看涨=流动性最好=对手盘最厚=空头最舒服的入场时机。\n\n 市场从不奖励合群，只奖励看对且敢干的人。 https://t.co/3yJeS7GWIL https://t.co/9Tu3U2BzSB", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113198488242749679"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:12:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113529026962948338"], "id": "2113529026962948338", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 12255, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113422343569858735", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "昨天易中天里的几十亿爆仓盘，不过是一群贪鬼的集体火葬。今天的暴力反弹，与你又何干？\n\n昨天新易盛光脚阴线、近200亿成交砸出来的，不是什么“AI信仰崩塌”，是市场高潮中，里那些拿杠杆当信仰的私募，被贪婪按在地上摩擦。 https://t.co/6N5cWNGfCR", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113529026962948338"}, {"article": {"title": "别再乱跟单了：飞凡、虾哥、杀破狼其实不在同一条赛道"}, "author_id": "1990512523800686594", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:55:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113464328309387713"], "id": "2113464328309387713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一张图看懂加密推特：长期 / 趋势 / 叙事 / 技术 / 链上 / 实盘 https://t.co/5nhky61v9D", "url": "https://x.com/ShockBear240458/status/2113464328309387713"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:42:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113189264192417876"], "id": "2113189264192417876", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 27804, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "几十亿爆仓，死在所谓基本面的\"正确\"之上\n \n光模块双雄暴跌，江浙私募几十亿强平。\n鳄鱼不怜悯浅滩挣扎的猎物，只在血流最浓处张嘴。\n \n基本面——上半年三家龙头净利224亿、订单排到2027\n\n所有人坐同一条船，船一晃，先掉下去的是杠杆最重的那批。", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113189264192417876"}, {"article": {"title": "《沈冰自述：我和周永康的故事》全景深度解读"}, "author_id": "2024405719940820992", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:44:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113521874411954178"], "id": "2113521874411954178", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 19119, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "https://t.co/yyWjILHOLy", "url": "https://x.com/cha747888/status/2113521874411954178"}, {"author_id": "2042909540102877184", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:29:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113352168866762792"], "id": "2113352168866762792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 215, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人一直看不懂三国演义最诡异的一幕：\n\n赵云长坂坡七进七出拼死抢出阿斗，刘备一把接过来狠狠摔在地上，赵云为何眼眶通红、泪水打转？\n\n那不是感动，那是心疼亲儿子。", "url": "https://x.com/Yudian_Zero/status/2113352168866762792"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113551847986532353"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:43:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113551884158124343"], "id": "2113551884158124343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/FCHwNoqjxt", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113551884158124343"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:06:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113436930725797968"], "id": "2113436930725797968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.23 https://t.co/ZWWxZyRI0m 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113436930725797968"}, {"author_id": "857945237104111618", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:27:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113547942506406249"], "id": "2113547942506406249", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2909, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "凡是kdj/macd/rsi的都是水货，\n凡是缠论的都是蠢货，\n凡是数浪的都是二货。", "url": "https://x.com/xuyuinfo5/status/2113547942506406249"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:51:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113629387207626784"], "id": "2113629387207626784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【缠论节奏 1/5】\n\n高手和低手的真正差距，往往不在选股，而在节奏。\n\n轮动只是节奏的一种表现，真正的核心节奏是买卖点。没有买卖点作为基础，任何轮动都是瞎转。\n\n你现在的操作，更多是在“追热点”，还是在等明确的买卖点？\n\n#缠论 #技术分析 #买卖点", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2113629387207626784"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113071347123228672"]}, "author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:54:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113071351929942128", "2113071553038479735"], "id": "2113071553038479735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 113, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "有人问 #缠论 有什么用？管不管用？\n\n看今天盘后HOOD 5分钟级别操作：在高点卖掉全部仓位，夜盘前买回基础仓，价差约2美元，直接避免了约400美元回撤。\n\n缠论不是用来预测的，具有当下的直观，可以用来在结构明确时做精确买卖点管理。你说有没有用？\n\n（以上为个人交易记录，不构成投资建议）\n#美股 https://t.co/KKMLzmxFO3", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2113071553038479735"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113076621590880363"], "id": "2113076621590880363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.21 https://t.co/xmUGYnMRN9 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113076621590880363"}, {"author_id": "793840805525893121", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:23:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113093770677989798"], "id": "2113093770677989798", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我遇到很多大V说自己是量化交易员，说缠论无用让早日脱离苦海。这些人都是自己没看懂书里的级别，还搞什么量化？岂不是亏更多吗？缠论教你的就是一整套思路让你进市场有严格的界定，没有这些标准绝不能买。一旦标准成立，买了就要等到卖点卖。所以成功率应该是99%，除非你自己不懂。", "url": "https://x.com/manonbezos/status/2113093770677989798"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113071347123228672"]}, "author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:54:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113071351929942128", "2113071553038479735"], "id": "2113071351929942128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人问 #缠论 有什么用？管不管用？\n\n看今天盘后HOOD 5分钟级别操作：在高点卖掉全部仓位，收盘前买回基础仓，价差约2美元，直接避免了约400美元回撤。\n\n缠论不是用来预测的，具有当下的直观，可以用来在结构明确时做精确买卖点管理。你说有没有用？\n\n（以上为个人交易记录，不构成投资建议）\n#美股 https://t.co/UMHb1OPpIh", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2113071351929942128"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113081427667628032"]}, "author_id": "1910907485554462720", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:34:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113081438061080941"], "id": "2113081438061080941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1986, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111756204213207477", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "一涨就追，一跌就慌？\n先别急，你可能把“一步回头”，当成了“整段掉头”。\n\n花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论｜DAY 05：线段\n\n说人话就是：\n笔像走一步，线段像走一段路。\n走路会有进有退，看方向，不能只盯着眼前那一步。\n\n今天记住三句话：\n\n三笔是起步，不是数到三就结束。\n起始要重叠，不是随便三笔都能连。 https://t.co/4J1vV91c35 https://t.co/ksDzuJ4Z81", "url": "https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2113081438061080941"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113624620901220352"]}, "author_id": "1868006938258128896", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:32:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113624625418489967"], "id": "2113624625418489967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🙏🙏🙏\n\n《谛深⼤师开⽰辑》-大众当共修！\n\n坐下弟子及声闻善知识众，汝等于群中听法，虽心得必然，却少有证！是乃修行\n大忌！\n\n何故是说？一切邪魔外道皆以是因缘，候其方便，飞精附体，口说经法，令众堕\n落！\n\n善知识，一切佛法皆实证门，故诸佛世尊，皆警告大众，凡有言说，皆无实义！ https://t.co/huUJqZMggh", "url": "https://x.com/wangjiziji/status/2113624625418489967"}, {"author_id": "781142310503403520", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:16:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113076916907553093"], "id": "2113076916907553093", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109275550628151734", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "在读《mind management， not time management》对于七种心智状态的时候又串联起来了，里面提到：\n\n将名词换成动词的核心在于剥离表象的程序，直达行为的目的。\n\n名词（季度评审）：通常代表一个静态的、程序化的“包裹”。 https://t.co/sikRGOTplN", "url": "https://x.com/n0t_r0t/status/2113076916907553093"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113331755226992640", "3_2113331787611156480"]}, "author_id": "1539246618452668416", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:09:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113331991387263366"], "id": "2113331991387263366", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 869, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2068897238542413886", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "20261023\n看看这酵母造些什么名词弄什么玄乎\n来骗返佣和会员费\n被闪亮眼睛的群众骂出屎\n还尼玛的缠论\n肠论之法兰西黑肠吧\n@Paris13Jeanne https://t.co/iHYj6Ikta2 https://t.co/oDWrsIaKdG", "url": "https://x.com/0nebcher/status/2113331991387263366"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113443547638829056"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:33:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113443564395069888"], "id": "2113443564395069888", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "霜降染层林\n登高赏秋色\n弘扬缠论\n惠泽众生 https://t.co/VdVGZFnOsc", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113443564395069888"}, {"author_id": "1642055218199429126", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:47:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113658469740167410"], "id": "2113658469740167410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BTC 行情观察｜10月23日\nBTC 从 84,000 美元上方回落至 81,500 美元附近，短线结构转弱，但 4 小时级别暂未确认反转。\n从缠论看，近期虽然出现了 S1 和 NESTED_SELL，但当时 4 小时趋势仍为 UP，因此没有通过当前策略的空头过滤。价格目前运行在 4 小时中枢约 81,166～83,150 区间附近。\n关键位置：\n-", "url": "https://x.com/xisi39341944284/status/2113658469740167410"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113147213513998336", "3_2113147458058678272"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-22T05:57:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113147798413889583"], "id": "2113147798413889583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大饼当下的走势节奏再次完美兑现，缠论这套体系，是一个客观的描述，和任何的主观分析无关，就如同阳光、空气，不管你是否认识，都客观存在着。\nbitcoin:native https://t.co/lkpgEtWfUP", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113147798413889583"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:44:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113129395023917408"], "id": "2113129395023917408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "同样一个“三买”，\n在日线里是突破，\n在周线里可能只是震荡。\n\n「买点，从来不是一个孤立的点。」\n\n多级别联立说的就是这件事：\n同一个信号，要放进更大一级的结构里再读。\n\n打个比方：\n您看到有人走出一间屋子，这是“离开”。\n退一步才发现，这间屋子在一个大院子里，\n他只是从一间屋走进了另一间。", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2113129395023